        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/edgy/mission_fox/scene_fox_contractcreation.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 252428ca-3f8e-4477-b2b9-58f18cff3e44).Image",
        "Description": "Five agents have decided to leave the ICA and start up their own contract agency. Normally this would not be a problem, as long as they do not interfere with ICA business.\r\rHowever, when these agents left, they each took something of irreplaceable value from the ICA.\r\rDiana want&apos;s you to eliminate the agents in any means you wish. If possible, try to recover the five Spice Girl&apos;s earrings they stole from her private collection.",
